      "id": 6300,
      "finding_type": "identity",
      "summary": "George A. Sorial: Egyptian-American attorney. Degrees from Boston University (BA, JD, MBA) and Seton Hall (LLM). Worked with Trump since 2002. Was Trump Organization EVP and Counsel managing global portfolio. From 2017 served as Chief Compliance Counsel. Left Trump Org June 7, 2019 amid increasing scrutiny. Co-wrote The Real Deal: My Decade Fighting Battles and Winning Wars with Trump. Co-founded Javelin Advisors LLC Nov 2024 with Keith Schiller and Robert Seiden. FARA lobbyist registered for Pakistan. LDA lobbyist for all Javelin clients. FEC donation 09/08/2025 to Sen. Katie Britt $5K jointly with Schiller.",
